# 10-20 after day1 (~14:00): the same loads with makoto-fan (the trial unit) holding the fans: settle, 2, 4 and 8
# workers (nice 19 matrixprod), then the unwind. Load off 95C, abort 98C, Card Side 57C; the run ends if makoto-fan
# stops, and makoto-fan keeps the fans afterwards.
c_idle ctl ctl 300 0
c_w2 ctl ctl 600 2
c_w4 ctl ctl 600 4
c_w8 ctl ctl 600 8
c_unwind ctl ctl 900 0
